installer: FIXED (this commit)
  tracked target byte-identical to before   : yes
  target repo working tree                  : clean
  hook path is still a symlink              : no
  hook is the shipped guard, executable     : yes
  report names the link it replaced         : yes
  report resolves it to the real file       : yes
  backup preserves the link, not its target : yes -> ../../scripts/my-hook.sh
  temp files left in the hooks directory    : 0

adjacent symlink paths, FIXED installer:
